<% content_for :title, "Unlock #{@scooter_code} — skooti" %>

  <header>
    <div class="logo">sko<span>oti</span></div>
    <nav class="tagline">unlock <%= @scooter_code %></nav>
  </header>

  <div class="wrap">
    <section class="sec">
      <div class="sec-k">Unlock <%= @scooter_code %></div>
      <div class="tryit unlock">
        <h2>Your unlock token for <%= @scooter_code %></h2>
        <div class="qr"><%= raw @qr_svg %></div>
        <p>At the vehicle, an app of the shop on your phone reads this QR and gives the token to the lock over Bluetooth. The lock checks the token by itself, with no connection to this site. This demo publishes no such app: its lock is a software copy of the real firmware.</p>
        <p class="note">Unlock token — it opens <%= @scooter_code %> once, for a few minutes, for whoever holds it:</p>
        <p class="card token"><%= @rental_token %></p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
